This is a good suggestion. However, we decided to do things a bit
differently. There is now a command ('X') to switch into discovery mode.
Naturally, it asks for verification. This way, if you want to go into
discovery mode you don't have to save and then restore; and it does get
rid of that annoying double prompt on saves.
